    "text": "Bleaching powder is <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mo>)</mo></math> i.e. it contains a salt of an oxoacid which is <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></math> .<br />and anhydride of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></math> is <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math> .<br /><math><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mover accent=\"false\"><mo>→</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math>",
